      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manase akaba aina emyaka 12 kayaliire engoma. Aha ngoma akamaraho emyaka 55 ayemire Yerusalemu. Nyina eibaralye ni Hefuziba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manase ayagokera Omukama, yakora amahano ag'Omukama yabingire Abaisiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba akombeka obuju obwo Hezekia ishe yabaire akambwire. Yayombekera Baali ealutare, yakora Ashera, nk'eby'Omukama Ahabu owa Isiraeli yabaire akozire. Yafukamira enyanyinyi yazikolera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayombeka ealutare ezindi omuli Rwensinga y'Omukama, ey'Omukama yagambiireho ati, “Ndafukamirwagamu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyanyinyi yazombekera ealutare etali emoi omuli nyakabuga zombili eza Rwensinga y'Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omutabani yamwokya, yamutamba ekitambo; yaragura, yabasha, yashuba yata naraguza aha balikugambisa ebizimu, yayekwata n'abarogi. Yagokera Omukama yamunigaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekishushani kya Ashera ekibaijano ekyo yabaire abaizire yakiteka omuli Rwensinga ey'Omukama yabaire nagamba orwo yagambiire Daudi na Solomoni omutabani ati, “Omuli Rwensinga egi n'omuli Yerusalemu eyo naronkire omu nganda zona za Isiraeli nimwo nditura eirai lyona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Abaisiraeli tindibaihya mu nsi eyo nahaire baish'enkurubo kubenjeza, kabalyegendeleza bakakora ebyo nabaragiire byona, n'ebyo Musa omwiru wange yabaragiire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai tibahuliire, na Manase yabohya, bahena kushagaho amahanga ag'Omukama yasilikize.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama agambira omu kanwa k'abairube abarangi ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Orwo Manase omukama wa Yuda yakora amahano aga, akakora ebibi kushaga eby'Abaamori abamwebembeire bakozire, akafakaza na Yuda aha rw'okufukamira ebihuuku bya wenene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Ruhanga wa Isiraeli nagamba ati, Yerusalemu na Yuda ninyija kubateza enaku ezo buli omoi alizihulira amatwi galimwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yerusalemu ngibonabonyie nk'okwo nabonabonyize Samaria, nkabonabonyia Omukama Ahabu n'abaijukuru. Yerusalemu ngite akayaba nk'okwo omuntu aragaza eshahani akagijumika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab'eihanga lyange abaruhonokireho nabo mbaihemu emikono, mbanagire ababisha babo, babaite babanyage, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "enshonga bangokeire banigaza, kwema kiro ekyo baish'enkurubo barugire Misiri kugoba mwaha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Manase akaita abantu bangi abataina ntambara, Yerusalemu kugyema rubaju oru kugituruka rubaju oru yagijuza obwamba, lekanu obufu bw'okufukamira ebihuuku obwo yafakaize Yuda bakagokera Omukama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu ebindi byona ebyo Manase yakozire, n'obufu obwo yafakaire, bihandikirwe omu Kitabo ky'Amakuru g'Abakama ba Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manase atahya, bamubyalira omu busitani ya Uza omu kikaare. Amoni omutabani alya engoma, amusikira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amoni akalya engoma aina emyaka 22. Aha ngoma akamaraho emyaka ebili ayemire Yerusalemu. Nyina eibaralye ni Meshulemeti. Akaba ali muhara wa Haruzi owa Yotiba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akagokera Omukama nk'okwo Manase, ishe yamugokeire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akamurondora omu bigiro byona, yakolera ebihuuku ebyo ishe yakoleire, yabifukamira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akebwa Omukama Ruhanga wa baish'enkuru, tiyakozire bilikushemelera Mukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaramata ba Amoni bamushenga, bamwitira omu kikaare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai abamushengire bona abanyansi bakabaita. Yosia omutabani baba niwe bateka aha ngoma, amusikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu ebindi byona ebyo Amoni yakozire, bihandikirwe omu Kitabo ky'Amakuru g'Abakama ba Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakamubyalira omu magashani omu busitani ya Uza. Yosia omutabani alya engoma, amusikira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
